[[!meta title="GDAL/OGR cheat sheet"
        description="Command-line recipes for the GDAL/OGR geodata tools: vector, raster and a few odd jobs."]]
[[!tag gis gdal]]

Cheat sheet for the GDAL/OGR command-line geodata tools.  It was originally kept
on [GitHub](https://github.com/fpl/gdal-cheat-sheet) as a fork of a previous release.

* [[Vector operations|gdal/vector]]: inspect, convert, clip, reproject,
  dissolve, join and load vector data with `ogrinfo` and `ogr2ogr`.
* [[Raster operations|gdal/raster]]: inspect, convert, reproject, clip,
  merge and analyse rasters with `gdalinfo`, `gdal_translate`, `gdalwarp`,
  `gdaldem` and friends.
* [[Other recipes|gdal/other]]: KML and CSV conversions, MODIS, shell
  helper functions and bounding boxes.

